        -> p1 fault lo/hi/mid/wr (PC 0x18, DMA0, DMT0), p1 census, p1 widths, p3 interim, p2 int byte/half; instruction fetch NOT CLAIMED (the qualifier)
    - default: the bus error a badaddr() probe expects
